  displayName: Mysterious Encounter
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 920ede2975b53bc48b6e08bcdf26a4bd, type: 3}
  summaryText: Mysterious Encounter
  fullText: "I met an older woman on the way to the marketplace. I didn't get her
    name, but she handed me this strange device without much explanation.\n\nThere
    was something knowing in her eyes\u2014as if she recognized me, or perhaps knew
    something about me that I didn't know myself.\n\nThe device she gave me feels
    important, though I can't explain why."
